    "content": {
      "value": "<p local-id=\"87a34fa73363\">This page tracks design deliverables required from the design team based on approved business and functional requirements. Phase 1 designs are mostly done by now (June). Phase 2 designs are work in progress and planned to be done by mid-July 2026. We will update <strong>Design Status</strong>, <strong>Accenture Review</strong>, and <strong>Zimmermann Sign-off</strong> in our weekly meetings with the design team.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:local-id=\"5c8b259a\" ac:macro-id=\"3322f9bb-0c8f-4c45-bbfc-ffbe8e3d702c\" ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:rich-text-body><p local-id=\"75f6b6b8\"><strong>How to use this tracker</strong><br/>This table is organized by functional area where priority is mostly based on the build order. We will add final designs through Figma links in the <strong>Figma Link</strong> column as designs are available, and capture unresolved questions, dependencies, or missing states in <strong>Notes / Open Items</strong>.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><table ac:local-id=\"78011c08\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-display-mode=\"default\" data-table-width=\"1800\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 71.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 116.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 130.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 196.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 88.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 162.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 132.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 126.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 157.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 617.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"36c1970a\"><th ac:local-id=\"4ce422c638a8\"><p local-id=\"1a46520eedec\"><strong>Prio</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"66bb5d6f8bcc\"><p local-id=\"193c62481e2a\"><strong>Epic</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"661cd301bd97\"><p local-id=\"1c2c1270f6dd\"><strong>Component</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"e2bb40231cbf\"><p local-id=\"5b3f6bc51438\"><strong>Component Detail</strong></p></th><th ac:local-id=\"64e814fe99ef\"><p local-id=\"21e71259e209\"><strong>S